{"seq":2,"slug":"cancellation-and-timeout","title":"取消与超时：异步任务的生命周期终止","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/patterns/cancellation-and-timeout","wordCount":1079,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"取消与超时-异步任务的生命周期终止\">取消与超时：异步任务的生命周期终止</h1><p>异步任务的取消（Cancellation）是 Rust 异步编程中最容易被忽视、也最容易出错的领域。与 Go 的显式 <code>context.Cancel()</code> 或 Java 的 <code>Future.cancel()</code> 不同，Rust 通过<strong>丢弃 Future</strong>来实现取消——这是由语言的所有权系统自然决定的，但也带来了独特的挑战：如何保证在任意 <code>.await</code> 点被取消时，资源能被正确清理？</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust 的取消即 drop：当 Future 被 drop 时，当前挂起点之后的代码不会执行，但已分配的资源通过 <code>Drop</code> trait 自动清理。&quot;取消安全&quot;（cancellation-safe）是指 Future 在任意 await 点被 drop 后不会留下不一致状态——跨越 await 点的半完成操作是最常见的取消不安全根源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Task[正在运行的任务] --&gt;|abort 或 timeout| Drop[Future 被 Drop]&#10;    Drop --&gt;|Drop trait 清理| Resources[资源正常释放]&#10;    Drop --&gt;|下个 await 点停止| Incomplete[未执行的后续代码]&#10;    Incomplete --&gt;|取消安全| Safe[状态一致]&#10;    Incomplete --&gt;|取消不安全| Corrupted[状态不一致 - Bug]\">graph TD\n    Task[正在运行的任务] --&gt;|abort 或 timeout| Drop[Future 被 Drop]\n    Drop --&gt;|Drop trait 清理| Resources[资源正常释放]\n    Drop --&gt;|下个 await 点停止| Incomplete[未执行的后续代码]\n    Incomplete --&gt;|取消安全| Safe[状态一致]\n    Incomplete --&gt;|取消不安全| Corrupted[状态不一致 - Bug]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>取消机制</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>取消时机</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>JoinHandle::abort()</code></td>\n<td>强制终止单任务</td>\n<td>下个 await 点</td>\n<td>任务最终结束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>timeout(dur, fut)</code></td>\n<td>单次操作超时</td>\n<td>定时器触发后</td>\n<td>Future 被 drop</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>select!</code> 分支丢弃</td>\n<td>竞争完成</td>\n<td>其他分支就绪时</td>\n<td>需取消安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CancellationToken</code></td>\n<td>协作式关闭</td>\n<td>token.cancel() 时</td>\n<td>需任务主动检查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"rust-取消的工作原理\">Rust 取消的工作原理</h2><p>在 Rust 中，取消一个 Future 就是不再 poll 它，并通过 <code>drop</code> 来清理资源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 如果 JoinHandle 被 abort 或 dropped，&#10;// 运行时会停止 poll 对应的 Future，并在下一个 await 点&quot;注入&quot;取消&#10;let handle = tokio::spawn(long_running_task());&#10;&#10;// 方式 1：显式取消&#10;handle.abort();&#10;&#10;// 方式 2：drop JoinHandle（任务继续运行，但不再追踪结果）&#10;drop(handle); // 任务不被取消，只是与 JoinHandle 脱钩&#10;&#10;// 方式 3：tokio::time::timeout 超时取消&#10;let result = tokio::time::timeout(&#10;    Duration::from_secs(5),&#10;    long_running_task(),&#10;).await;&#10;// 超时时，long_running_task() 的 Future 被 drop\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 如果 JoinHandle 被 abort 或 dropped，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 运行时会停止 poll 对应的 Future，并在下一个 await 点\"注入\"取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let handle = tokio::spawn(long_running_task());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方式 1：显式取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>handle.abort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方式 2：drop JoinHandle（任务继续运行，但不再追踪结果）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>drop(handle); // 任务不被取消，只是与 JoinHandle 脱钩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方式 3：tokio::time::timeout 超时取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let result = tokio::time::timeout(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Duration::from_secs(5),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    long_running_task(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 超时时，long_running_task() 的 Future 被 drop</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键区别：<strong><code>handle.abort()</code> 会标记任务为&quot;应被取消&quot;，任务在下一次 poll 时通过特殊机制被终止</strong>。被取消的任务会在当前正在等待的 <code>.await</code> 点接收到取消信号，Future 被 drop，其中的 <code>Drop</code> 实现（如 <code>Mutex</code>、文件句柄等）正常执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"取消安全-cancellation-safety\">取消安全（Cancellation Safety）</h2><p>并非所有 Future 在任意时刻被取消都是安全的。&quot;取消安全&quot;（cancellation-safe）指一个 Future 在被 drop 时不会留下不一致的状态或资源泄漏。</p>\n<h3 id=\"什么是取消不安全-cancellation-unsafe\">什么是取消不安全（Cancellation-Unsafe）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 取消不安全的例子：读取一个完整的消息&#10;async fn read_message(stream: &amp;mut TcpStream) -&gt; Message {&#10;    let mut header = [0u8; 4];&#10;    stream.read_exact(&amp;mut header).await;   // await point 1&#10;&#10;    let len = u32::from_be_bytes(header) as usize;&#10;    let mut body = vec![0u8; len];&#10;    stream.read_exact(&amp;mut body).await;      // await point 2&#10;&#10;    Message::from_bytes(&amp;header, &amp;body)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 取消不安全的例子：读取一个完整的消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn read_message(stream: &#x26;mut TcpStream) -> Message {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut header = [0u8; 4];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    stream.read_exact(&#x26;mut header).await;   // await point 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let len = u32::from_be_bytes(header) as usize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut body = vec![0u8; len];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    stream.read_exact(&#x26;mut body).await;      // await point 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Message::from_bytes(&#x26;header, &#x26;body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果这个 Future 在 await point 1 和 2 之间被取消：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>header 已从 TCP 流中读取，但 body 尚未读取</li>\n<li>TCP 流中还有 <code>len</code> 字节未消费</li>\n<li>下次调用 <code>read_message</code> 时，会将旧消息的 body 当成新消息的 header</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这就是典型的取消不安全：取消后留下了不一致的状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"取消安全的实现模式\">取消安全的实现模式</h3><p>修复上面的例子：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 取消安全的版本：使用缓冲区保证原子性&#10;async fn read_message_safe(stream: &amp;mut TcpStream) -&gt; Message {&#10;    // 使用 bytes::BytesMut 或类似的有状态缓冲区&#10;    let mut buf = BytesMut::new();&#10;&#10;    loop {&#10;        // 每次 await 时，已读取的数据都保存在 buf 中&#10;        stream.read_buf(&amp;mut buf).await;&#10;&#10;        if buf.len() &gt;= 4 {&#10;            let len = u32::from_be_bytes(buf[..4].try_into().unwrap()) as usize;&#10;            if buf.len() &gt;= 4 + len {&#10;                // 完整消息就绪&#10;                let _ = buf.split_to(4); // 消费 header&#10;                let body = buf.split_to(len);&#10;                return Message::from_bytes(&amp;body);&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 取消安全的版本：使用缓冲区保证原子性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn read_message_safe(stream: &#x26;mut TcpStream) -> Message {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 使用 bytes::BytesMut 或类似的有状态缓冲区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut buf = BytesMut::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 每次 await 时，已读取的数据都保存在 buf 中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stream.read_buf(&#x26;mut buf).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if buf.len() >= 4 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let len = u32::from_be_bytes(buf[..4].try_into().unwrap()) as usize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if buf.len() >= 4 + len {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // 完整消息就绪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                let _ = buf.split_to(4); // 消费 header</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                let body = buf.split_to(len);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return Message::from_bytes(&#x26;body);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键原则：<strong>跨越 await 点的操作应当是幂等的或使用持久化缓冲区</strong>，确保取消后重试能正确恢复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tokio-select-与取消语义\">tokio::select! 与取消语义</h2><p><code>select!</code> 宏是取消最常见的触发点，它并发运行多个 Future，当第一个完成时<strong>丢弃其余所有 Future</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"tokio::select! {&#10;    result = fetch_data() =&gt; {&#10;        process(result);&#10;    }&#10;    _ = tokio::time::sleep(Duration::from_secs(10)) =&gt; {&#10;        eprintln!(&quot;Timeout!&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;    _ = shutdown_signal() =&gt; {&#10;        eprintln!(&quot;Shutting down&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;// 只有一个分支会执行，其余两个 Future 被 drop（取消）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>tokio::select! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = fetch_data() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        process(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _ = tokio::time::sleep(Duration::from_secs(10)) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        eprintln!(\"Timeout!\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _ = shutdown_signal() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        eprintln!(\"Shutting down\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 只有一个分支会执行，其余两个 Future 被 drop（取消）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>select!</code> 默认<strong>随机选择</strong>哪个就绪分支执行，以避免饥饿。这意味着即使某个分支总是最快就绪，它也不一定总是被选中。</p>\n<h3 id=\"select-循环中的取消安全陷阱\">select! 循环中的取消安全陷阱</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 危险：recv() 不是取消安全的&#10;async fn process_messages(mut rx: Receiver&lt;Message&gt;) {&#10;    let mut buf = String::new();&#10;&#10;    loop {&#10;        tokio::select! {&#10;            // 如果第二个分支先就绪，recv() Future 被 drop&#10;            // 但消息可能已经从 channel 中取出（取消不安全！）&#10;            msg = rx.recv() =&gt; {&#10;                buf.push_str(&amp;msg.unwrap());&#10;            }&#10;            _ = some_other_event() =&gt; {&#10;                process_buffer(&amp;buf);&#10;                buf.clear();&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 危险：recv() 不是取消安全的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn process_messages(mut rx: Receiver&#x3C;Message>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut buf = String::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokio::select! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 如果第二个分支先就绪，recv() Future 被 drop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 但消息可能已经从 channel 中取出（取消不安全！）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            msg = rx.recv() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                buf.push_str(&#x26;msg.unwrap());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _ = some_other_event() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                process_buffer(&#x26;buf);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                buf.clear();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>正确做法是使用 <code>biased</code>（顺序选择而非随机）或将 channel 接收操作包装成取消安全的版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"loop {&#10;    tokio::select! {&#10;        biased;  // 按声明顺序检查，避免随机取消&#10;&#10;        _ = some_other_event() =&gt; {&#10;            process_buffer(&amp;buf);&#10;            buf.clear();&#10;        }&#10;        msg = rx.recv() =&gt; {&#10;            buf.push_str(&amp;msg.unwrap());&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tokio::select! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        biased;  // 按声明顺序检查，避免随机取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _ = some_other_event() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            process_buffer(&#x26;buf);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buf.clear();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        msg = rx.recv() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buf.push_str(&#x26;msg.unwrap());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"超时的实现方式\">超时的实现方式</h2><p>超时是取消的最常见触发原因。Tokio 提供了多种超时 API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tokio::time::{timeout, sleep, Duration};&#10;&#10;// 方式 1：timeout 包装器（最常用）&#10;match timeout(Duration::from_secs(5), fetch_data()).await {&#10;    Ok(result) =&gt; println!(&quot;Got: {:?}&quot;, result),&#10;    Err(_) =&gt; println!(&quot;Timed out&quot;),&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 方式 2：sleep + select!（需要取消安全）&#10;tokio::select! {&#10;    result = fetch_data() =&gt; println!(&quot;Got: {:?}&quot;, result),&#10;    _ = sleep(Duration::from_secs(5)) =&gt; println!(&quot;Timed out&quot;),&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 方式 3：timeout_at（精确截止时间）&#10;let deadline = tokio::time::Instant::now() + Duration::from_secs(5);&#10;timeout_at(deadline, fetch_data()).await;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::time::{timeout, sleep, Duration};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方式 1：timeout 包装器（最常用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>match timeout(Duration::from_secs(5), fetch_data()).await {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(result) => println!(\"Got: {:?}\", result),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Err(_) => println!(\"Timed out\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方式 2：sleep + select!（需要取消安全）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokio::select! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = fetch_data() => println!(\"Got: {:?}\", result),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _ = sleep(Duration::from_secs(5)) => println!(\"Timed out\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方式 3：timeout_at（精确截止时间）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let deadline = tokio::time::Instant::now() + Duration::from_secs(5);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>timeout_at(deadline, fetch_data()).await;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>超时的底层实现使用了 Tokio 的时间轮定时器。当超时触发时，定时器调用内部 Future 的 Waker，<code>timeout</code> Future 在下一次 poll 时检测到超时并 drop 内部 Future，同时返回 <code>Err(Elapsed)</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优雅关闭-传播取消信号\">优雅关闭：传播取消信号</h2><p>生产系统中，优雅关闭需要将取消信号传播到所有正在运行的任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tokio::sync::broadcast;&#10;use tokio_util::sync::CancellationToken;&#10;&#10;async fn run_server() {&#10;    // CancellationToken 是 tokio-util 提供的取消信号工具&#10;    let token = CancellationToken::new();&#10;    let mut set = JoinSet::new();&#10;&#10;    // 启动多个工作任务，每个任务监听取消信号&#10;    for i in 0..10 {&#10;        let token = token.clone();&#10;        set.spawn(async move {&#10;            tokio::select! {&#10;                _ = token.cancelled() =&gt; {&#10;                    println!(&quot;Worker {} received shutdown signal&quot;, i);&#10;                }&#10;                _ = do_work(i) =&gt; {&#10;                    println!(&quot;Worker {} finished normally&quot;, i);&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        });&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 等待关闭信号（如 Ctrl+C）&#10;    tokio::signal::ctrl_c().await.unwrap();&#10;&#10;    // 发送取消信号给所有工作任务&#10;    token.cancel();&#10;&#10;    // 等待所有任务完成（或超时）&#10;    while set.join_next().await.is_some() {}&#10;    println!(&quot;All workers shutdown cleanly&quot;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::sync::broadcast;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio_util::sync::CancellationToken;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn run_server() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // CancellationToken 是 tokio-util 提供的取消信号工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let token = CancellationToken::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut set = JoinSet::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 启动多个工作任务，每个任务监听取消信号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..10 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let token = token.clone();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        set.spawn(async move {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            tokio::select! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                _ = token.cancelled() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    println!(\"Worker {} received shutdown signal\", i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                _ = do_work(i) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    println!(\"Worker {} finished normally\", i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 等待关闭信号（如 Ctrl+C）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tokio::signal::ctrl_c().await.unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 发送取消信号给所有工作任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    token.cancel();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 等待所有任务完成（或超时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while set.join_next().await.is_some() {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"All workers shutdown cleanly\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>取消机制</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>JoinHandle::abort()</code></td>\n<td>强制终止单个任务</td>\n<td>任务在下一个 await 点被取消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>JoinSet::abort_all()</code></td>\n<td>强制终止一组任务</td>\n<td>等效于对每个 handle 调用 abort</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CancellationToken</code></td>\n<td>优雅关闭、协作式取消</td>\n<td>需要任务主动检查 <code>token.cancelled()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>timeout</code></td>\n<td>单次操作超时</td>\n<td>内部 Future 被 drop，注意取消安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>broadcast::Sender</code></td>\n<td>多消费者关闭信号</td>\n<td>适用于扇出（fan-out）的关闭通知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>参见本章节：<a href=\"structured-concurrency\">结构化并发</a> — JoinSet 提供的结构化取消保证；<a href=\"stream-and-async-iteration\">Stream 与异步迭代</a> — Stream 在关闭时的取消语义。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Rust 通过 drop 实现取消——这与语言的所有权系统一致，无需额外的取消标志传递。核心挑战是&quot;取消安全&quot;：确保 Future 在任意 await 点被 drop 时不留下不一致状态。使用持久化缓冲区、避免&quot;半完成&quot;的操作、以及在 <code>select!</code> 中注意 <code>biased</code> 选择是保证取消安全的主要手段。<code>CancellationToken</code> 是 Tokio 生态中实现协作式优雅关闭的标准工具。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"取消与超时：异步任务的生命周期终止","id":"取消与超时-异步任务的生命周期终止"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust 取消的工作原理","id":"rust-取消的工作原理"},{"level":2,"text":"取消安全（Cancellation Safety）","id":"取消安全-cancellation-safety"},{"level":3,"text":"什么是取消不安全（Cancellation-Unsafe）","id":"什么是取消不安全-cancellation-unsafe"},{"level":3,"text":"取消安全的实现模式","id":"取消安全的实现模式"},{"level":2,"text":"tokio::select! 与取消语义","id":"tokio-select-与取消语义"},{"level":3,"text":"select! 循环中的取消安全陷阱","id":"select-循环中的取消安全陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"超时的实现方式","id":"超时的实现方式"},{"level":2,"text":"优雅关闭：传播取消信号","id":"优雅关闭-传播取消信号"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"结构化并发：安全管理异步任务的生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/patterns/structured-concurrency"},"next":{"title":"Stream 与异步迭代：处理异步产生的值序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/patterns/stream-and-async-iteration"}}